<title>MEXICO: Soriana says to invest $400 mln.</title>
<headline>Soriana says to invest $400 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retailer Organizacion Soriana plans to invest almost $400 million in new outlets over the coming four years, the company director general said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Soriana Director General Ricardo Martin said in a ceremony to open a new store that the company hoped to expand its network to 100 outlets, from a current 59.</p>
<p>((--Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey newsroom +528 3457677))</p>
